      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟春天的经典赛激战连连，\n希望她能在夏季集训好好转换心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1df6d2905b787195f9e4e2c883d5252ed4e64954f915aeddc201733de0823b",
